  "body": "Dummy M0 guest build from commit `685e427fdfb5dc26fa5db634fd0706b59b8ed493`.\n\nTwo independent GitHub runner builds produced identical artifacts. SHA256SUMS and GitHub provenance attestations bind the published files.\n\nExpected SNP measurement: `c0ac09eb9957dbee62a4479d376ee5a2e889afd446dc857bdbfc7d1e7e547574e57f55c9ec79b98edad0fc82c1d8ea18`.\n\nTarget: the launch profile in launch-profile.json. Kernel policy must be checked separately. No hardware guest launch is performed by this workflow.\n\nDummy secrets only. Guest state is ephemeral; no persistent disks or networking. M1 handoff and live attestation verification are not implemented. Native Ubuntu build tools are not fully pinned; matching builds establish repeatability for this run, not universal reproducibility.\n"
}